# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# REPORTING - COMPANY RESULTS (MechanicOnly POLICY)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The report places a quote by its CreatedAt month whatever its status is,
# splits Sent into pending and expired, and answers an empty period with
# zeros rather than 404, so the page has one rendering path.

@AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress = {{$processEnv AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}
@WebUI_Origin = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_WEBUI_ORIGIN}}
@NonAdminEmail = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_MECHANIC_EMAIL}}
@NonAdminPassword = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_MECHANIC_PASSWORD}}
@SeededYear = 2026
@EmptyYear = 2001
@InvalidMonth = 13
@OutOfRangeYear = 1999

# COVERAGE GAP (do not fill with a fabricated token):
# The customer-token 403 case cannot be produced against the live API, for the
# same reason the catalog and quote authz files record: a Customer person never
# receives an IdentityUserId, and registration only accepts mechanics. The 401
# path below is the observable half of the MechanicOnly policy.


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [Setup][Reporting] Clear any session cookie left by a previous file (204 or 401, not asserted)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}

###

### [Negative][Reporting] Company results require authentication (401 expected)
# @no-cookie-jar
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/company-results?year={{SeededYear}}

?? status == 401

###

### [Setup][Reporting] Login as non-admin mechanic (200 expected)
# @name csrfSource1
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{NonAdminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{NonAdminPassword}}"
}

{{
  exports.CsrfToken = response.headers['set-cookie']?.find(c => c.startsWith('autoservice_csrf='))?.match(/^autoservice_csrf=([^;]+)/)?.[1];
}}

?? status == 200

###

### [Positive][Reporting] Whole-year report returns the four status rows (200 expected)
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/company-results?year={{SeededYear}}

?? status == 200

###

### [Positive][Reporting] Report defaults to the current year when no parameter is sent (200 expected)
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/company-results

?? status == 200

###

### [Positive][Reporting] Single-month report narrows the same period (200 expected)
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/company-results?year={{SeededYear}}&month=9

?? status == 200

###

### [Positive][Reporting] Empty period answers 200 with zeroed rows, not 404
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/company-results?year={{EmptyYear}}

?? status == 200

###

### [Negative][Reporting] Month above 12 is rejected (400 expected)
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/company-results?year={{SeededYear}}&month={{InvalidMonth}}

?? status == 400

###

### [Negative][Reporting] Month below 1 is rejected (400 expected)
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/company-results?year={{SeededYear}}&month=0

?? status == 400

###

### [Negative][Reporting] Year below the accepted range is rejected (400 expected)
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/company-results?year={{OutOfRangeYear}}

?? status == 400

###

### [Setup][Reporting] Logout after the authenticated checks (204 expected, the login above guarantees a live session)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}

?? status == 204
